{"id":"c61095fa91dccaa0","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-game4-mixed-strategy-profile.md","title":"ZFC Game4 Mixed Strategy Profile","display":"df-zfc-game4-mixed-strategy-profile — ZFC Game4 Mixed Strategy Profile","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game4-mixed-strategy-profile","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game4-mixed-strategy-profile"],"display":"df-zfc-game4-mixed-strategy-profile — ZFC Game4 Mixed Strategy Profile","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game4-mixed-strategy-profile"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game4-mixed-strategy-profile</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game4-mixed-strategy-profile — ZFC Game4 Mixed Strategy Profile"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N,\\vec S,\\sigma\\in V\">\\(N,\\vec S,\\sigma\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> (finite-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame4MixedStrategyProfile}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame4MixedStrategyProfile}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}mixed\\text{-}strategy\\text{-}profile} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame4MixedStrategyProfile}_S(N,\\vec S,\\sigma)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Finite}(N)\\land N\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec S,N,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec S))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\sigma,N,\\operatorname{ran}(\\sigma))\\land\\forall i\\in N\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Finite}(\\vec S(i))\\land\\vec S(i)\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\sigma(i),\\vec S(i),[0,1])\\land\\sum_{s\\in\\vec S(i)}\\sigma(i)(s)=1\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}mixed\\text{-}strategy\\text{-}profile} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame4MixedStrategyProfile}_S(N,\\vec S,\\sigma)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Finite}(N)\\land N\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec S,N,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec S))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\sigma,N,\\operatorname{ran}(\\sigma))\\land\\forall i\\in N\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Finite}(\\vec S(i))\\land\\vec S(i)\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\sigma(i),\\vec S(i),[0,1])\\land\\sum_{s\\in\\vec S(i)}\\sigma(i)(s)=1\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both profiles are now functions on the player set, and finiteness uses the predicate supplied by its dependency rather than an unsupported spelling.</li>\n<li>Set-valued strategy carriers and probability functions use the exact three-place function predicate; no map has the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> as codomain.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}$ (finite-set predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"N,\\vec S,\\sigma\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGame4MixedStrategyProfile}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}mixed\\text{-}strategy\\text{-}profile} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame4MixedStrategyProfile}_S(N,\\vec S,\\sigma)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Finite}(N)\\land N\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec S,N,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec S))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\sigma,N,\\operatorname{ran}(\\sigma))\\land\\forall i\\in N\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Finite}(\\vec S(i))\\land\\vec S(i)\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\sigma(i),\\vec S(i),[0,1])\\land\\sum_{s\\in\\vec S(i)}\\sigma(i)(s)=1\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":1527,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2202","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-game4-mixed-strategy-profile.md|58-df-zfc-game4-mixed-strategy-profile]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d9a25b0ac94a3598","36d7463d215be751"]}